  CellName: Chum
  Description: 'Shallows - intensity 1 of Chum: eight small shoals close to the core - room to learn
    the paint and the throw. The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392 u). No
    environment prefab - the reef (8 shoals, 512 prisms of 7 u, 0 of them shielded crust) is
    laid by ChumController. 6 tameable tadpoles graze it outside the nucleus; 4 omni
    crystals respawn inside it (the scene''s CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the full
    arena (2,569 prisms, 345,330 volume). Authored by Tools/Build/author_chum_assets.py -
    re-run it rather than hand-editing.'
